<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.lei.reads ~ show ~ swarm-show

`lares lei show` reads the board. `--rite <rite> --branch <name>` together read one rite's standing lei (`data.lei`), and `--head` asks after one head. Naming no face with several faces open, it reads every open face's line (`data.faces`).

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ board · line

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`board` params=`~ read the board`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`line` params=`rite/kukulu branch/main ~ read one rite's line`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ rite · branch · head · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`rite` params=`takes/rite needs/all-of:rite,branch ~ the rite whose line to read`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`branch` params=`takes/name needs/all-of:rite,branch ~ the line's branch`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`head` params=`takes/commit ~ ask after one head`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/index ~ the face whose line this reads or strings, a whole count from 0`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ a read through the store door`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`~ a missing rite, branch or lei, a stray flag, or a malformed count`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ board

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`board` params=`exit/0 fields/[[lei faces]] ~ the board, a line's standing lei, or every open face's line`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

